    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Our recently launched Bachelor of Science in Nursing (Direct Entry programme) will guide the next cohort of young nurses to not only make an impact, but also encourage more to join us in changing this wonderful vocation. These were the words that were echoed frequently at the AKU SONAM -Kenya Alumni Social that took place on Saturday 24, June 2023 at the Nairobi Serena Hotel.",
